---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy notice · SpotAI"
  description="What the SpotAI website collects when you browse it or join the waitlist, how it is used and how to ask for it to be deleted."
  langs={['en']}
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main" class="priv">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="wide">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="lead">This notice covers this website only. What the SpotAI app does with your data is explained in the app's privacy centre.</p>

      <h2>What the waitlist form collects</h2>
      <p>
        When you join the waitlist, I receive what you type: your name, WhatsApp number, gym name and whether you are a member or
        an owner, plus the page you sent it from. The form sends it by email using EmailJS, to {SITE.email}.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The site uses Google Analytics to see how visitors find and use it. It sets first-party cookies and sends usage data, such
        as pages viewed, approximate location and the source of the visit, to Google. The site also uses Microsoft Clarity, a free
        tool that records anonymised heatmaps and session replays so I can see where visitors get stuck. Text typed into the
        waitlist form is masked and is not recorded. None of it is used for advertising, and you can block it with a browser
        extension or by disabling cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>What I use it for</h2>
      <p>Only to reply to you about SpotAI and to understand which pages help gym owners and members. I do not sell or share your details.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>To see, correct or delete what you sent, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
      <p class="priv__date">Last updated 4 November 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .priv {
    padding-block: clamp(96px, 12vw, 140px) 72px;
  }
  .priv .wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .priv h2 {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .priv p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .priv__date {
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
